Z||000023||fierov8||09-15-2000||05:11 PM||||I'd be interested in:<P>IMSA body kit for GT<BR>GT whale tail spoiler<BR>Gt front fascia extension<BR>Integrated rocker panels<P>..of course, not all for one car  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>And I second the recommendation of someone buying out the Ryane Motorsports jigs and drawings -- more folks would buy if it were reasonable priced.<P>-jeff d||||reg||1
